feat(subscriptions): modern plans page + SINPE comprobante upload + admin approve/reject flow (still inactive)

Builds the customer-facing plans page and the admin payment-approval flow on top of
the existing infra; all behind PAYMENTS_ENABLED (default off) + admin-only preview.

- Plans page (subscription-panel.tsx) redesigned modern-SaaS style: two plan cards
  (Anual ₡30.000 "2 meses gratis" highlighted, Mensual ₡3.000), benefits, then a
  payment-method step — OPTION 1 Tarjeta (primary, behind gateway stub: shows
  "disponible pronto" / falls back to SINPE), OPTION 2 SINPE Móvil o transferencia
  (manual): SINPE instructions + amount + reference + comprobante upload (image/PDF)
  → submit for review. Shows "en revisión" while pending and an active-plan summary
  when premium. Responsive.
- Comprobante upload: /api/payments/receipt → Cloudinary (contratacr/comprobantes,
  resource_type auto for image+PDF); auth required, gated like the rest.
- Manual submit: /api/payments/subscription/manual → submitManualPayment() creates a
  PENDING payment (grants nothing) and supersedes any prior pending one.
- Admin approval (visible now, admin-only) on /admin/suscripciones: AdminPaymentApprovals
  lists pending payments with the comprobante link; Approve → approveManualPayment()
  marks the payment paid + activates/extends the subscription automatically; Reject →
  rejectManualPayment() (kept in history with reason). Plus the existing per-pro manual
  activate + "Eliminar / reset" in the admin user-profile card.
- DB migration 055 (apply after 054): adds receipt_url, reviewed_by, reviewed_at +
  a 'rejected' payment status + a pending index.

Flag OFF unchanged: pros keep full free access, regular users see zero subscription
UI; plans page only via the admin preview. No card data stored (gateway-only).

